#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:47
msgid "CPU fan profiles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:49
msgid ""
"Values 2 and 3 of ``pwm1_enable`` select the two complete automatic profiles "
"implemented by the firmware. Writing either value reloads the whole CPU fan "
"curve, including firmware state which is not visible through the ACPI EC "
"window. Other values are rejected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:55
msgid "System fan thresholds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:57
msgid ""
"The two writable system-fan temperatures are rounded to whole degrees "
"Celsius and clamped to preserve strict ordering between both visible "
"thresholds and the firmware's internal third threshold. The third threshold "
"does not select a new PWM target and is therefore not exposed as another "
"auto point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:63
msgid "Resume state preservation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/minisforum-um780xtx.rst:65
msgid ""
"Fan settings are held in EC RAM. On the supported firmware, initialization "
"during s2idle resume reloads the factory system-fan curve. The driver "
"retains the last coherent CPU profile and system-fan thresholds selected "
"through its interface and restores them synchronously at resume."
msgstr ""
